  "event": "Rooftop: Edge and Daigo sparring, entry through all reviewed exits",
  "entries": [
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "source_payload_sha256": "249e7931ec30b45bbbb3f418d75fe438472b5e1ebede8d7e1d6050b79f09fde6",
      "text": "ARGH, NO GOOD!\nI'M NO MATCH AT ALL!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "source_payload_sha256": "bf5889a37a993c52b9971b473b1e3c56be247993f134c26c2db25e34c1787666",
      "text": "ON THE ROOF, I HEAR\nEDGE'S VOICE. HE AND\nDAIGO SEEM TO BE\nDOING SOMETHING.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "source_payload_sha256": "26656361c4d847c49c33d0a28ba8a56b599807450daa3980a36566e37d5a7a7b",
      "text": "CALL OUT TO THEM\nLEAVE THEM ALONE",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "source_payload_sha256": "b25c41ee2652225613bc82d99e2ea4bbcd8ec39f171e8446eb60a92b1860a528",
      "text": "BETTER LEAVE THEM.\nTHEY LOOK BUSY...\nWHERE SHOULD I\nGO NEXT?",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "source_payload_sha256": "cbe383b303f004f3160c55755b8d4f7dfb9b9014fe776941e995abe457d52606",
      "text": "HI, DAIGO.\nEDGE, WHAT ARE YOU\nTWO DOING?",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "source_payload_sha256": "b920d3beb42c9241f3974e6d99d150a895f0d070b3cf9e2749745e10fdb3a49a",
      "text": "JUST A LITTLE\nSPARRING...",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "source_payload_sha256": "f4a2c3e531f2a2722eb5cb16e89a2a7adf29028e1e8ea69ac778f7f7f802ef47",
      "text": "YOU'VE GOT A LONG\nWAY TO GO, EDGE.\nYOUR KNIFEWORK IS\nSTILL IMMATURE.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "source_payload_sha256": "2dc705b28f08b3f26a077219114b1851e6304078ca00ca84344ceefebbdf9bbc",
      "text": "SO YOU'RE TRAINING\nWITH DAIGO.\nNO WONDER YOU COULD\nBARELY FIGHT BACK.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "source_payload_sha256": "79aa7ef8a65ce197becf1ce72309fb3209145c6844e3ec798579dabb56c06a61",
      "text": "THAT'S OUR BOSS.\nI CAN'T MATCH HIM.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "source_payload_sha256": "2979f8ecf02315f3e72572b96739b32ad24321b44acc00c70e0eb4ca977db796",
      "text": "YOU NEED SPIRIT,\nNOT JUST TECHNIQUE.\nMASTER YOUR KNIFE\nBEFORE FACING ME.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "source_payload_sha256": "d865d2d057460c4108b2337b9c9975f35753dc52749a5bfd0b25075b6fe0da4f",
      "text": "I SEE...\nTHEN YOU'LL NEVER\nBEAT DAIGO, EDGE.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "source_payload_sha256": "17263b63d32830974d1fcad5b7c2350aca51b07cc0a56a0382d69c701f155682",
      "text": "WHAT?!\nYOU WANNA FIGHT ME?",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "source_payload_sha256": "b95b19b6141d6bda8b53cf606f348ca447be2f6f41ceae0c6224993dea4e7b34",
      "text": "NO, THAT'S NOT\nWHAT I MEANT...",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "source_payload_sha256": "c391eda3a481a31a393601a26f615815d89879ce1097351a7da7592d6322b20c",
      "text": "I'M GONNA BE\nTHE NEXT BOSS.\nI CAN'T LET THIS\nSETBACK STOP ME!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "source_payload_sha256": "ec55fa9dd4e3343115691e80b6331b9d1395c16e18241e99d8633f2cf32b2c81",
      "text": "NEXT BOSS?\nAFTER DAIGO\nGRADUATES, THEN?",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "source_payload_sha256": "3b50ccfec002e793c55836c43369e35aee1d1ed091ff102184433fa4dc0e3c31",
      "text": "WHO SAYS I HAVE TO\nWAIT THAT LONG?\nRIGHT, BOSS?",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "source_payload_sha256": "6efb976ec2acce9413c5cc663b1205df22f1e3f4322dafe958aa4be84d583854",
      "text": "EDGE IS RIGHT.\nDEFEAT ME AND YOU\nCAN TAKE MY PLACE\nWHENEVER YOU LIKE.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 0,
      "index": 84,
      "source_payload_sha256": "8125e9939cd11ba7ab9490bda7a0e0e3d904f0f5c503c69715fb4f56a8a75748",
      "text": "{0}, YOU TOO.\nCOME AT ME ANYTIME.\nEVEN RIGHT NOW.",
