      "text": "EDGE IS RIGHT.\nDEFEAT ME AND YOU\nCAN TAKE MY PLACE\nWHENEVER YOU LIKE.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 84,
      "source_payload_sha256": "8125e9939cd11ba7ab9490bda7a0e0e3d904f0f5c503c69715fb4f56a8a75748",
      "text": "{0}, YOU TOO.\nCOME AT ME ANYTIME.\nEVEN RIGHT NOW.",
      "controls": [
        [
          8196,
          [
            17
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 85,
      "source_payload_sha256": "3983fa33d259d9a36c5da4f1f774e588707e5cf294ce7d709943a19104ea0b5f",
      "text": "IF YOU WANNA FIGHT\nTHE BOSS, YOU GOTTA\nFIGHT ME FIRST.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 86,
      "source_payload_sha256": "1e98c493d4abb27a6539e832ff5f9d2dbcaa1d0de21ec3727725c1a840b198e6",
      "text": "SPAR WITH DAIGO\nSPAR WITH EDGE\nDECLINE BOTH",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 87,
      "source_payload_sha256": "4a3f2703e6498352d3a4141cc9b65a1a01e0ebd018f34e5bd4738ce65a2634c8",
      "text": "ALL RIGHT, THEN.\nDAIGO, PLEASE\nSPAR WITH ME!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 88,
      "source_payload_sha256": "458103a0f9d21b99df86e229ad5ea19f8a8d1438b102debda51ced370f79dd69",
      "text": "OH, YOU'LL TAKE\nME ON?\nYOU'VE GOT GUTS!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 89,
      "source_payload_sha256": "30022f82de8b2f79ea89f5a1a09874eef5a26638970a8ce288278a62de889fd7",
      "text": "HEH, INDEED.\nI'LL REWARD YOUR\nCOURAGE. COME AT ME!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 90,
      "source_payload_sha256": "a168a957221047744614b9b958768f00108ef73f7903a3066c1474c097865366",
      "text": "HAAH! TAKE THAT!\n{0}...\n{1}WHAM! THUD!",
      "controls": [
        [
          12290,
          [
            15
          ]
        ],
        [
          12290,
          [
            255
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 91,
      "source_payload_sha256": "d934a4f58e61a75169002fb022a37c2a9591bc6d81bbf3cb7d4053a5ba0b7200",
      "text": "NO GOOD!\nI CAN'T LAND A HIT!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 92,
      "source_payload_sha256": "95b584ec84f715d87384c878854ef69c2097b3d5790f4263c8856fd4f1d9f991",
      "text": "HAHAHA!\nYOU'RE EVEN WORSE\nTHAN ME! HOPELESS!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 93,
      "source_payload_sha256": "7cca6354ea8706a91938e7dac197ba78ded6b356b48a55ed6fa335c988239b0a",
      "text": "HM... YOU DID WELL\nAT YOUR SKILL LEVEL.\nI'LL GIVE YOU THAT.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 94,
      "source_payload_sha256": "d051ee2fec2b2432a43a7ccdbd0fa6cf031f3420c61aca5b15744d3957a981d1",
      "text": "NOW IT'S UP TO YOU.\nA YEAR OF SERIOUS\nTRAINING COULD EVEN\nLET YOU SURPASS ME.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 95,
      "source_payload_sha256": "9bc551626ddddcadc7ee4695d29aabc99cc33bbc55acf0aa54ef5be43ff04d4f",
      "text": "TRAIN AT SCHOOL\nOR WITH YOUR CLUB.\nUSE IT ALL TO BETTER\nYOURSELF. GOOD LUCK!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 96,
      "source_payload_sha256": "d6a948454bbe961093bd9bbff08190edf7c2a9ce879fa7a63f5b2a5e5bb4cb71",
      "text": "YES, DAIGO!\nI'LL DO MY BEST!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 97,
      "source_payload_sha256": "7a3022a8e67a4ff57e38c45ed7dc4af299c89c60344023fc63614ca1e5157f23",
      "text": "ALL RIGHT, THEN.\nLET ME SPAR WITH\nYOU FIRST, EDGE!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 98,
      "source_payload_sha256": "9e0738c66ed8b3a0a6f8d23b262831bdd2f8eac6319a32eb89c04b5bfb72e22d",
      "text": "HAHAHA!\nTHE BOSS BEAT ME,\nBUT I WON'T LOSE\nTO YOU!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 99,
      "source_payload_sha256": "7785a25c4770a6c29d5b30171a41b987f2b7700a4714deee9a6532b1f6f3b8ac",
      "text": "ALL RIGHT!\nHERE I COME!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 100,
      "source_payload_sha256": "6c8be392ec307d7395c3dabd226b553beab477a83a385617ac1dd6c68da457b1",
      "text": "{0}WHAM!{1} BAM!\n...\n{2}CRACK!{3} THUD!",
      "controls": [
        [
          12290,
          [
            15
          ]
        ],
        [
          12290,
          [
            255
          ]
        ],
        [
          12290,
          [
            15
          ]
        ],
        [
          12290,
          [
            255
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 101,
      "source_payload_sha256": "d7a17f7e59beeab827c692b5383ff672b1081f9c0da7d51b5e79b4ee955ee96e",
      "text": "HUFF... HUFF...\nYOU'RE GOOD...{0}",
      "controls": [
        [
          8195,
          [
            9
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 102,
      "source_payload_sha256": "7f3b7db13d40f501e8ebe9756e4e67c5d1327c6299c41f8d1fa1a943a89aad30",
      "text": "HUFF... HUFF...\nSO ARE YOU, EDGE...",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 103,
      "source_payload_sha256": "cf49c80d114570a8f1abca2482617d830f30a332fcfccd0a8ed517782926494d",
      "text": "OKAY, THAT'S ENOUGH.\nI'LL WATCH YOU BOTH\nTRAIN SOME MORE.\nYOU DID WELL.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 104,
      "source_payload_sha256": "f7ae86e59e54b6281ac4561099705c017111cf297261f7cee02f092bc2bc1dc3",
      "text": "BOSS...\nI CAN STILL FIGHT!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 105,
      "source_payload_sha256": "f5f7e21a8bccbe8ab3c372ee49876641cc0e3d2412231b8f81d9ba45db3ed865",
      "text": "YOU'RE EXHAUSTED.\nDON'T ACT TOUGH.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 106,
      "source_payload_sha256": "52048be37df94f517640f55b7214755f978b69d0d81ce0ea2fe70d6144179a0e",
      "text": "THIS WAS SPARRING.\nIN OTHER WORDS...\nYOU BOTH STILL NEED\nTRAINING. GOT IT?",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 107,
      "source_payload_sha256": "7abbce8c257a5fb30b1368996746c2978005975e473df8666f4356aa75f19364",
      "text": "KEEP TRAINING HARD\nTHIS YEAR. YOU'LL\nGET STRONGER. THEN\nI'LL TAKE YOU ON.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 108,
      "source_payload_sha256": "d6a948454bbe961093bd9bbff08190edf7c2a9ce879fa7a63f5b2a5e5bb4cb71",
      "text": "YES, DAIGO!\nI'LL DO MY BEST!",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 109,
      "source_payload_sha256": "ccfb3705f140650170ee93d6838ac76f70f09c041b89231607235a4580919792",
      "text": "HEH.{0}\nI WON'T LOSE TO YOU!",
      "controls": [
        [
          8195,
          [
            9
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 110,
      "source_payload_sha256": "d5e1f6efe11468fbaa828ecaaef85b33e934419a0053a74760879d5c00de4333",
      "text": "I COULDN'T DO THAT.\nFIGHTING YOU OR EDGE\nWOULD BE COWARDLY.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 111,
      "source_payload_sha256": "e3ec60df21e9da4ebc7ec115d78bbfd9e49a2e377cdb22591a91dc9d9f63bb6a",
      "text": "{0}...\nI NEVER KNEW YOU\nWERE SUCH A COWARD.\nI'M DISAPPOINTED.",
      "controls": [
        [
          8196,
          [
            17
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 112,
      "source_payload_sha256": "708da6c41ad46a6fcb01f0a25495b40d3a0d4989e8b8dd6f1caf414b78a637f7",
      "text": "MAN, THIS IS ONLY\nSPARRING! WHAT ARE\nYOU SO SCARED OF?",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 113,
      "source_payload_sha256": "e058c4bfcac09b59614fab947cfdede6c2cdd7714efc03f7910c5624882d6777",
      "text": "NO, THAT'S...",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 114,
      "source_payload_sha256": "7fa2a4a185d6fe7c1e7ed623b2a1b786de008e6303927c6a040c0c2b350258a7",
      "text": "ENOUGH, EDGE.\nFIGHTING WHEN YOU'LL\nLOSE ISN'T COURAGE.\nRETREAT TAKES GUTS.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 115,
      "source_payload_sha256": "d0ead9e2a0bde477b9977a6f9afb92bd7075d14a896ca57bc64463fca1e0a057",
      "text": "...I SEE.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 116,
      "source_payload_sha256": "9e97a93b1ace8be38470ddd8960a7f7e7922f80c766ada2a20283e8dfe56e4d9",
      "text": "TRAIN HARD THIS\nYEAR. USE YOUR CLUB\nAND SCHOOL TRAINING\nTO IMPROVE YOURSELF.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 117,
      "source_payload_sha256": "8fb4a6be3619a20ba9aee40a9eb29ad43e9d6c8efdac71bac182d7a1eb941e72",
      "text": "THEN WE'LL SEE\nWHETHER YOUR CHOICE\nWAS RIGHT.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 118,
      "source_payload_sha256": "c886542cbefbd402a269338dfcb3983322155dcff50c8bafed3b7c873dc2c92d",
      "text": "Y-YES!\nI'LL DO MY BEST.",
      "controls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": 1,
      "index": 119,
      "source_payload_sha256": "b5c2c8189462440eb28f861defddad32f9bbb320fd5eb45182604f5bd3d5d07c",
      "text": "HM...\nTHAT'S THE SPIRIT.",
      "controls": []
    }
  ]
}
